===== README.md =====

# Fetch Browser Worker

Cloud browser executor for Fetch.

Fetch Vercel backend -> Browser Worker -> Browser Use -> Chromium -> Web

Required Railway variables:
- HF_TOKEN
- WORKER_TOKEN

Optional:
- BROWSER_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-120b:fastest
- HF_BASE_URL=https://router.huggingface.co/v1
- BROWSER_MAX_STEPS=30
- BROWSER_TASK_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=240

Endpoints:
- GET /health
- POST /execute

POST /execute example:
{
  "task": "Find the official price of the product",
  "url": "https://example.com",
  "conversation_id": "optional",
  "workflow_id": "optional"
}

Header:
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_WORKER_TOKEN

The first MVP does not automate passwords, OTPs, payment credentials, or protected
financial actions.


